[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="User Manual/MarginContainer/NinePatchRect/MarginContainer" unique_id=1989094141]
layout_mode = 2
text = "User Manual

Welcome to Human Safety Hotline. In this game you play as an employee of the call centre, human safety hotline, short for HSH. 

To play the game, you will:
1. Click the box with the exclamation mark on it to to to the main game page.
2. Click start the day to start your day of shift.
3. Pick up the calls and read the caller's ask carefully.
4. Use the wiki function to read and identify the entity that the caller has encountered
5. Use the answering function to pick out the determined answer.
6. Repeat!

Use the button below the start game button to reread user manual."

